{"quotes":[{"segments":["My first unsupervised Internet was in a public library in the mid 90’s with my friend Dan. We would sit down and experience the Internet super highway together. Saturday morning tennis club had given way to a psychedelic assemblage of science fiction web rings, Lycos web chat rooms, Sonic the Hedgehog pages and Jurassic Park fandom.

